  <item>
    <title>【10】以后这里就是我们的家~</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66cb0fccead5fc3792473250</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66cb0fccead5fc3792473250</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Aug 2024 15:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在相处过程中，两个不同的个体总会有这样那样的分歧</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是因为有感情的存在</span></p><span></span><p><span>使得这些分歧也会被感情淡化</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为我喜欢你，我愿意每天飞过重峦叠嶂，就为了和你待一会儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱，从来都不是妥协</span></p><span></span><p><span>但它处处包含着妥协</span></p><span></span><p><span>晚安~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luYBeF9hq3IxgWWEd4VwRHhY4tvu.m4a" length="7085621" type="audio/mp4"/>
