  <item>
    <title>【8】我喜欢你，谁都不知道~</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c806acead5fc3792d76a8d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c806acead5fc3792d76a8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Aug 2024 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果你身边有人特立独行，不在乎别人的眼光</span></p><span></span><p><span>不用奇怪</span></p><span></span><p><span>是她在乎的，和你不一样罢了</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为喜欢你这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span>和世界逆行</span></p><span></span><p><span>这件事儿，很酷不是吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿你们都有一份可以奋不顾身的喜欢.......</span></p><span></span><p><span>晚安</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lleb7MGJjOSOD-Nirz4EkOR_m7p0.m4a" length="5462257" type="audio/mp4"/>
