  <item>
    <title>【6】总有人会在你身后，保护你~</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668cb50c8fcadceb90ff87c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668cb50c8fcadceb90ff87c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jul 2024 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你心里有没有那么一个人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你做的所有事情，都想与他有关......</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以你尽力去找你们之间的关联......</span></p><span></span><p><span>哪怕这个联系八杆子打不着......</span></p><span></span><p><span>但你依旧满心欢喜......</span></p><span></span><p><span>他给你的喜欢也许很别扭......</span></p><span></span><p><span>并且当他需要帮助的时候......</span></p><span></span><p><span>你当然义无反顾......</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqcD9o2tOFBdBWSK1keWrCz1bcpC.m4a" length="6804905" type="audio/mp4"/>
